QuestGuidance.Register("en",80,{
[2529]="7003F2D7\n1\tToast to Bandobras's Health\tThe Challenge Field is located just east of Brockenborings. To participate in the Bullroarer's Challenge, Tobias Brockhouse told you to stand on the starting platform, pick up your official Bullroarer's Challenge brew tankard, toast to Bandobras's health, and make it across the north fence to the other platform, where Belgo is standing, before time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Sigismond North-took\tSigismond North-took is in Brockenborings. Speak with Sigismond North-took to claim your prize.\n",
[2530]="7003F2D8\n1\tToast to Bandobras's Health\tThe Challenge Field is located just east of Brockenborings. To participate in the Bullroarer's Challenge, Tobias Brockhouse told you to stand on the starting platform, pick up your official Bullroarer's Challenge brew tankard, toast to Bandobras's health, and make it across the south fence to the other platform, where Belgo is standing, before time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Sigismond North-took\tSigismond North-took is in Brockenborings. Speak with Sigismond North-took to claim your prize.\n",
[2531]="7000D97B\n1\tToast to Bandobras's Health\tThe Challenge Field is located just east of Brockenborings. To participate in the Bullroarer's Challenge, Tobias Brockhouse told you to stand on the starting platform, pick up your official Bullroarer's Challenge brew tankard, toast to Bandobras's health, and make it across the fence in twenty one seconds to the other platform, where Belgo is standing, before time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Sigismond North-took\tSigismond North-took is in Brockenborings. Speak with Sigismond North-took to claim your prize.\n",
[2532]="70018DEE\n1\tDefeat leader of the intruders within Bult-kâr\tThe entrance to Bult-kâr lies within Mezer-serej. Burkni has asked you to defeat the leader of the intruders within Bult-kâr.\n2\tTalk to Burkni at Mezer-serej\tBurkni is at Mezer-serej. With the defeat of their leader, the intruders within Bult-kâr have had their morale weakened. You should return to Burkni and tell him of your victory.\n",
[2533]="70018DF0\n1\tDefeat intruders in Bult-kâr (total: 20)\tThe entrance to Bult-kâr lies within Mezer-serej. Burkni has asked you to assist him in clearing Bult-kâr of the intruders within.\n2\tTalk to Burkni at Mezer-serej\tBurkni can be found at Mezer-serej in the eastern halls of Zelem-melek. You should return to Burkni to receive a reward for your efforts.\n",
[2534]="70018DEF\n1\tBring the dwarf hand-axes to Burkni at Mezer-serej\030Collect dwarf hand-axes (total: 8)\tThe entrance to Bult-kâr lies within Mezer-serej. Burkni is investigating rumours of implements of high lineage within the store-house of Bult-kâr. To that end, he has tasked you with entering the store-house and gathering dwarf hand-axes for him to study.\n",
[2535]="70005D1E\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Digswell's table\tPostman Moresby can be found south of the hill near the centre of Brockenborings. Deliver the satchel to Postman Moresby as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty, and keep the mail satchel from getting wet! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2536]="70005D1C\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Smallburrow's table\tPostman Bolger can be found on the east side of Budgeford, north of the pig pens. Deliver the satchel to Postman Bolger in Budgeford as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty, and keep the mail satchel from getting wet! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2537]="70005D19\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Boffin's table\tPostman Cotton can be found north-east of The Green Dragon in Bywater, far to the south of Overhill. Deliver the satchel to Postman Cotton in Bywater as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty and keep the mail satchel dry! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2538]="70005D17\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Took's table\tPostman Grubb can be found west of the centre of Hobbiton, north of Tuckborough. Deliver the satchel to Postman Grubb in Hobbiton as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty and don't let the satchel get wet! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2539]="70005D12\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Newbuck's table\tPostmaster Proudfoot can be found in Michel Delving, near Town Hole. The square outside Town Hole is surrounded by a stone wall. Deliver the satchel to Postmaster Proudfoot in Michel Delving as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2540]="70005D15\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Redsmith's table\tPostmaster Proudfoot can be found in Michel Delving, near Town Hole. Town Hole is surrounded by hedges. Deliver the satchel to Postmaster Proudfoot in Michel Delving as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty and don't let the satchel get wet! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2541]="70005D14\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Twofoot's table\tPostman Redsmith can be found in the centre of Needlehole. Deliver the satchel to Postman Redsmith in Needlehole as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty, and keep the satchel away from water! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2542]="70005D18\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Grubb's table\tPostman Boffin can be found in the centre of Overhill, far to the north of Hobbiton. Deliver the satchel to Postman Boffin in Overhill as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty, and do not let the mail satchel get wet! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2543]="70005D1D\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Bolger's table\tPostman Digswell can be found in the town of Scary, north of the town centre. Deliver the satchel to Postman Digswell in Scary as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty and do not let the mail satchel get wet. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2544]="70005D1B\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Spinner's table\tPostman Smallburrow can be found north-east of Stock, very near the Brandywine Bridge. Deliver the satchel to Postman Smallburrow near the Brandywine Bridge as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty and don't let the mail satchel get wet! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2545]="70005D16\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postmaster Proudfoot's table\tPostman Took can be found at the centre of Tuckborough. Deliver the satchel to Postman Took in Tuckborough as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty, and keep the satchel dry! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2546]="70005D13\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postmaster Proudfoot's table\tPostman Twofoot can be found north-west of the cross-roads in Waymeet, north-east of Michel Delving. Deliver the satchel to Postman Twofoot in Waymeet as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2547]="70005D1A\n1\tCollect the satchel from Postman Oddfoot's table\tPostman Spinner can be found in the centre of Woodhall. Deliver the satchel to Postman Spinner in Woodhall as quickly as possible. Let no nosey hobbits interfere with your duty, and do not let the satchel get wet! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[2548]="70042F62\n1\tDefeat trolls on the crude span of the Great Bridge ([see journal]/6)\tThe crude span can be found at the centre of the Great Bridge in central Osgiliath. Damrod has asked you to defeat trolls atop the crude span constructed by the Morgul-host in the hope that it will weaken the bridge.\n2\tTalk to Damrod\tDamrod can be found in the culverts of Osgiliath. You have defeated several trolls atop the Great Bridge, but it is unclear if your efforts bore fruit. You should now return to Damrod.\n",
[2549]="70067C4D\n1\tCollect intact crab claws ([see journal]/8)\030Collect crab shells ([see journal]/8)\030Collect delectable crab meat ([see journal]/8)\tKeteph's continued success weighs upon him, and he makes another request of you regarding the crabs that walk the shores south and west of the outpost of Jax Phanâl. He asks that you gather meat, shells, and claws from the crabs and then return to him at Jax Phanâl.\n2\tReturn the crab meat, shells, and claws to Keteph\tKeteph's continued success weighs upon him, and he makes another request of you regarding the crabs that walk the shores south and west of the outpost of Jax Phanâl. He asks that you gather meat, shells, and claws from the crabs and then return to him at Jax Phanâl.\n",
[2550]="70017368\n1\tTalk to Celofa\tCelofa is in the Foundations of Stone in Moria. In order to further your training as a Burglar, you have been sent to find Celofa, a fellow Burglar of great renown.\n2\tTalk to Celofa\tCelofa is in the Foundations of Stone in Moria. In order to further your training as a Burglar, you have been sent to find Celofa, a fellow Burglar of great renown.\n",
[2551]="700000B3\n1\tMeet Sterling Proudfoot for further Burglar training\tSterling Proudfoot is in Buckland, west of the town of Bree, in Bree-land. You have been told to speak with Sterling Proudfoot, a skilled burglar who likely has much to share about your chosen career.\n2\tTalk to Sterling Proudfoot\tSterling Proudfoot is in Buckland, west of the town of Bree, in Bree-land. You have been told to speak with Sterling Proudfoot, a skilled burglar who likely has much to share about your chosen career.\n",
[2552]="700687B0\n1\tSearch through rubble in Kamîr Kateb\tIt's possible that things of note are still buried under rubble at Kamîr Kateb. Kamîr Kateb is located in the north-western corner of the Tor-gardens.\n2\tTalk to Rimâti at the Pot and Quill\tYou found a damaged ink bottle near the ruins of Kamîr Kateb. You should show it to Rimâti at the Pot and Quill.\n",
[2553]="7005A78F\n1\tTalk to Elskur\tElskur can be found in eastern Azanulbizar. Talk to Elskur.\n2\tParticipate in the war of Azanulbizar\tThe battle for Azanulbizar will take place before the gates of Moria. You should take part in the battle for Azanulbizar.\n3\tSpeak with Hersegg\tHersegg can be found in Akrâz-zahar. You should ask Hersegg about the necklace Elskur buried for his wife.\n4\tSearch for the buried necklace\tThe necklace can be found in the mountains east of the Mirrormere in Dimrill Dale. You should look for the buried necklace.\n5\tTalk to Hersegg\tHersegg can be found in Akrâz-zahar. You should bring the necklace to Hersegg.\n6\tBring the necklace to Elgun\tElgun can be found in Erebor. You should bring the necklace to Elgun.\n",
[2554]="70002239\n1\tBring silver-nuggets to Machar\030Collect silver-nuggets (total: 8)\tThe city of Dûn Covád is in the western hills of Fasach-falroid, far to the north of Aughaire. The Ongbúrz have constructed a wooden palisade in front of the entrance. Machar is in the Búth Sánkhas of Aughaire, south-east of the market. Machar, winded from his previous excursion into Dûn Covád, has asked you to travel into the city and collect silver-nuggets from the Orcs that now live there.\n",
[2555]="70040B07\n1\tBurn the towers at Makham Mijann\tThe Corsair camp Makham Mijann is located in eastern Belfalas, along the River Ringló. Burn the towers at Makham Mijann.\n2\tBurn the guard towers (total: 6)\030Burn the look-out towers (total: 2)\tThe Corsair camp Makham Mijann is located in eastern Belfalas, along the River Ringló. Burn the towers at Makham Mijann.\n3\tCompleted\tBurned the towers at Makham Mijann.\n",
[2556]="7001BEA0\n1\tBurn the banner at Bolg Maufulug and defeat Stargûsh\tBolg Maufulug lies west and a little north from Talan Fanuidhol. Maenhador has asked you to burn the Orc-banner at Bolg Maufulug and defeat the camp's champion.\n2\tTalk to Maenhador at Talan Fanuidhol\tMaenhador is at Talan Fanuidhol, east and a little south of Bolg Maufulug. You should return to Maenhador with the tidings of your victory at Bolg Maufulug.\n",
[2557]="7001A4A0\n1\tBurn barrels of Warg-food (total: 6)\tBarrels of Warg-food can be found at Maudhul-ulur, south from Echad Glamodúd. Nordan has asked you to enter Maudhul-ulur and burn any casks of Warg-food you may find.\n2\tTalk to Nordan at Echad Glamodúd\tNordan is at Echad Glamodúd, north from Maudhul-ulur. You should return to Nordan with tidings of your success.\n",
[2558]="7001BEA1\n1\tBurn banner at Drûmaudhul and defeat Rukalai\tDrûmaudhul lies to the north-west from Talan Gwilith. Raingon has asked you to burn the Orc-banner at Drûmaudhul and defeat the camp's champion. Note: While Fanuidhol Defence is active, Raingon will not be available for quest completion or comments. You will have to wait for Fanuidhol Defence to end to complete this quest.\n2\tTalk to Raingon at Talan Gwilith\tRaingon is at Talan Gwilith, south-east of Drûmaudhul. You should return to Raingon with the tidings of your victory at Drûmaudhul. Note: While Fanuidhol Defence is active, Raingon will not be available for quest completion or comments. You will have to wait for Fanuidhol Defence to end to complete this quest.\n",
[2559]="7002C778\n1\tBurn the guard-tent\030Burn the pile of firewood\030Burn food-stores\030Burn Lanferth's tent\tThe brigand-camp is to the south of Idmar's camp along the banks of the Limlight River. Medwine has asked you to burn down the brigand-camp.\n2\tTalk to Medwine\tMedwine is at Idmar's camp in central Parth Celebrant. You should return to Medwine wih news of your success.\n",
[2560]="7006BF70\n1\tSave unburned scrolls in Kûr Anzar (total: 7)\tZuhûl, a Hamâti scholar, has asked you to save any unburned scrolls you find as you move through Kûr Anzar.\n2\tReturn to Zuhûl in Urmâkh with the unburned scrolls\tReturn to Zuhûl in Urmâkh with the unburned scrolls.\n",
})
